      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "If we make a mistake, should we cross it out neatly?"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Yes, draw one line through the wrong answer and rewrite."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Thank you for the clear instructions."
